@RestApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5141
@Token = Bearer reemplazar-jwt

### Health
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Periodos
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/periodos?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: {{Token}}

###
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/periodos
Authorization: {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anio": 2026,
  "nombre": "Gestión 2026",
  "inicioGestion": "2026-02-01",
  "finGestion": "2026-11-30",
  "trimestres": [
    { "numero": 1, "inicio": "2026-02-01", "fin": "2026-04-30" },
    { "numero": 2, "inicio": "2026-05-01", "fin": "2026-08-31" },
    { "numero": 3, "inicio": "2026-09-01", "fin": "2026-11-30" }
  ]
}

### Cursos
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/cursos
Authorization: {{Token}}

###
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/cursos
Authorization: {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nivel": "primaria",
  "grado": "5to",
  "paralelo": "A",
  "capacidadMaxima": 30
}

### Materias
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/materias
Authorization: {{Token}}

###
POST {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/materias
Authorization: {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "MAT-01",
  "nombre": "Matemática",
  "descripcion": "Álgebra y geometría"
}

### Cursos por periodo
GET {{RestApi_HostAddress}}/api/cursos-periodo
Authorization: {{Token}}
